(text "J2 -> Adafruit5206 named pads; VIN=3V3. J5 -> Pololu named pads. J7 -> charger ISET/GND/THERM.\nU1 BAT pads are absent. Remove U1 from sockets before connecting its USB port.\nR4 requires charger factory 1A jumper OPEN. Thermistor requires factory THERM bypass OPEN.\nPower flags declare off-board source/return through J1, J5 and D1; they are not hardware.\nCharge-temperature qualification remains OPEN: native BQ thermistor limits do not prove selected-pack 0..45C compliance." (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid aeb0581e-86b5-57a9-9fbf-f462a19065b5))
